Create one stopped container from a reviewed Engine create document. Image must already exist; no implicit image pull or container start.

POST /v1.53/containers/create. External write action; set confirmWrites=true and $retries=0 deliberately.

Inputs: name (optional), container (optional). Missing inputs may come from the selected connection profile config or explicit node defaults. Outputs: status, request_id, operation_url, value. Optional outputs are absent when the provider omits them. HTTP202 is acceptance, not completed work; operation_url exposes a same-origin asynchronous status URL when supplied.

